Description: Contacts for the COSMIC desktop
 Circle is the contacts application for the COSMIC desktop. Contacts are plain
 vCard files in a vdir layout, so they stay readable by khard, vdirsyncer, and
 anything else that speaks .vcf.
 .
 Editing a contact patches the stored card rather than rebuilding it, so
 photos, custom labels, and every property Circle does not itself display
 survive an edit and a sync.
 .
 Accounts are shared with the rest of the suite: an account added in Slate is
 already here, with one password in the system keyring rather than one per
 application.
